# never send dependency stores
**/.github
**/@personal-notes
**/.vscode
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/*.jsonl

# git + editor noise
.git
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# secrets/runtime data that must only ever reach a container via a volume mount at
# runtime, never baked into an image layer at build time (service Dockerfiles wholesale-copy
# their app dir, which would
# otherwise bake in live-test residue — real, if low-stakes, test-account
# data, and the service's own private key).
**/secrets
**/shattered-service.key
apps/*/data
